   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "What does the look express?",
   "texto": [
    "The imperfective presents a process, a repeated activity, or the fact that something was happening, without focusing on a limit. The perfect presents the action as a whole with a final point; in the past it is usually highlighted that it was completed. These are not times: each aspect may appear in the past or not the past."
   ]
  },
