   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Past, present and future",
   "texto": [
    "In the past, the verb matches the subject: **-л** (masculine), **-ла** (feminine), **-ло** (neutral), **-ли** (plural). In indicative, the inperfect not-past expresses present (**готовлю**, «I'm preparing / I'm preparing»); the not-past-perfect expresses future (**приготовлю**, «I'll prepare»).",
